A general framework parameterizing typed lambda calculi by a triple (sorts, axioms, rules), unifying systems like ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/simply-typed-lambda-calculus.td")}, System F, and the ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/calculus-of-inductive-construction.td")} under a single formalism.
